# Preview-Only Authenticated Postflight

Authenticated remote postflight and release checks use only {{previewWorkers}}, deployed
with `AUTH_PROVIDER_POLICY=preview_postflight_password` and a secret-bound Firebase password
identity (`POSTFLIGHT_PASSWORD_UID`).

## Requirements

- Authenticated checks must target preview URLs (`{{previewUrlHost}}`).
- Production and public browser flows remain Google-only.
- Point the preview build at the preview API Worker: set `SOCIAL_API_BASE_URL` in the
  Cloudflare Workers Builds preview environment to the preview API Worker URL.
- Postflight credentials live in the operator keychain only; never in source, chat, D1, or
  logs.
{{productionDomainNote}}

## Forbidden

- Authenticated postflight against production domains ({{productionDomains}}).
- Using real Social Google accounts for feature slice verification.
- Demanding, pasting, or storing production Google OAuth tokens in chat or tickets.

## Allowed Without Account

- Unauthenticated production probes (`/health`, `/openapi.json`, a fail-closed `401`),
  Cloudflare API inventory, D1 migration verification, and Worker deployment status.